# 13\. Potential Bug — Date/Time and Timezone

Your report displays:

> Oct 7, 2026 08:22 PM

Since this is a local government application, make sure your backend isn't storing local time incorrectly.

Ideally:

### Database

Store timestamps consistently, preferably UTC:

```
2026-10-07T12:22:00Z
```

### Frontend

Convert to the user's local timezone:

```
Oct 7, 2026
08:22 PM
```

Otherwise you can eventually get problems where:

```
Database date = Oct 7
Frontend date = Oct 8
```

and this can also cause **date filter bugs**.

