# Recommended Status Constants

Don't store arbitrary strings everywhere.

Use constants/enums:

```
const REPORT_STATUS = {
  PENDING_VALIDATION: "PENDING_VALIDATION",
  VALIDATED: "VALIDATED",
  ASSIGNED: "ASSIGNED",
  IN_PROGRESS: "IN_PROGRESS",
  RESOLVED: "RESOLVED",
  REJECTED: "REJECTED"
};
```

And categories:

```
const REPORT_CATEGORY = {
  INFRASTRUCTURE: "INFRASTRUCTURE",
  ENVIRONMENTAL: "ENVIRONMENTAL",
  HEALTH: "HEALTH",
  SAFETY: "SAFETY"
};
```

Then display human-friendly names:

```
PENDING_VALIDATION → "Pending Validation"
ENVIRONMENTAL → "Environmental"
```

This will eliminate many inconsistencies.

